# Compiler output. Every file here is produced from a `.rgr` under
# gallery/evg by the script that needs it — the EvgHarness live-build tools
# (evg_livebuild.js, evg_app.js) are built by its `npm run setup` — so a
# fresh clone builds them and never needs them committed.
#
# Same rule as lib/evg/bin, gallery/ui/bin, gallery/vela/bin, gallery/book/bin
# and gallery/css/bin.
*
!.gitignore
